From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:59:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] quickjs: Bump servo-quickjs for mozjs 0.26.14

With mozjs at 0.26.14, the pinned servo-quickjs 544db84, which is mozjs
0.26.9, would leave `--js-engine quickjs`'s patch unused. servo-quickjs
ae9eb96 is mozjs 0.26.14. It implements the stencil functions of
upstream's off-thread compilation of classic scripts (07ebaae, with
QuickJS patches Q50 and Q51), which ohos-main doesn't call yet, and it
compiles event handlers as standalone functions, whose name is not
bound in their own scope, as SpiderMonkey does (ae9eb96, patch Q52):
`<body onload="onload()">` called the handler itself instead of the
page's global `onload` function, until the stack overflowed.

Validation: servo-quickjs's `just test`, `just test-asan --no-fail-fast`, `just lint`, `cargo fmt --check` and `just test262` pass on the tree of ae9eb96, with a negative control for each fix. A full QuickJS WPT run of this branch (release, 60,788 tests) had 55 tests with unexpected results; in three reruns of those with each engine, none recurs with QuickJS only. The 33 that recur with both engines give the same results on this host with plain upstream base/2026-11-08 (26) or with ohos-main before this branch (6, see the previous commit), or as in ohos-main's stored CI run (1).
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; shim port, patches and validation by the agent during the 2026-11-08 sync)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml b/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
index 9af11c534c7..2e4a987cb79 100644
--- a/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
+++ b/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
@@ -5,4 +5,4 @@
 # were tested with. The shim's version must match the mozjs version that Cargo.toml requires, or
 # Cargo leaves the patch unused.
 [patch.crates-io]
-mozjs = { git = "https://github.com/openharmony-rs/servo-quickjs", rev = "544db84d9210b332e98baa8bb39a51c4c769001d" }
+mozjs = { git = "https://github.com/openharmony-rs/servo-quickjs", rev = "ae9eb96c65821a35d51e20c6e1e24e7479fc2fb1" }
